5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I worry the plans assume crews that no longer exist. We must check who is actually available to run this.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m tired of repeating the same mistakes. I want to see what happened when we tried these ideas before.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I suspect the delays are hidden in the approvals, not the drawings. I need to know who else has to say yes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried the budget numbers hide the long-term costs. I want to see where the money really goes.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I’m curious if the crowding complaints match reality. I want to see where the time actually goes for passengers.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, checking the past is wise. But we also need to know if the people to do the work are still here.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, agreed. But if the past failed, why repeat it? I’ll look at the old pilots to see what worked.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, budget is important, but if the project stalls, the money is wasted. I’ll check the committee minutes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. But I need to see the ledger to understand the real financial commitment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I’ll check the journey audits. If the machines aren’t the problem, we’re fixing the wrong thing.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will look into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will review the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will check the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will examine the journey audits on where minutes go and the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Victoria,,Let’s see if the data matches the promises. I’ll stick with my two choices to understand the staffing reality.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’m ready to see what the past tells us. Let’s hope the old pilots give us some answers.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will review my findings before we vote. The past is the only honest witness.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll stick with my two choices. Understanding the real costs is the only way to predict if this will survive.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m excited to see what we find! Let’s hope the data shows us where the real bottlenecks are.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
