35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The roster books show the late-turn pool is nearly empty. Overtime is covering everything, and the maintenance contract has no spare capacity.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The old pilots were successful! The contactless trial had no faults, and the late-evening pilot met its cost target. We should trust the past.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The committee minutes show the ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. And the pre-war shells are full of hidden voids.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital ledger is ring-fenced, but the operating subsidy is trimmed. Ticketing fees are higher than paving rates. The money is tight.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"The journey audits show most time is lost waiting for connections, not paying. The mid-city runs are slower, but crowds clear at the old rate.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, the pilots were good, but the staffing is the real problem. We can’t run new services if the crews are gone.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, I hear you. But the pilots prove the ideas work. We just need to make sure the staffing is sorted.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, the budget is tight, but the approval process is the bigger risk. If the operators don’t agree, nothing happens.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. But if the money isn’t there, the approvals don’t matter. We need a plan that fits the budget.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, the staffing is a concern, but the journey audits show the real issue is connections. We need to fix the flow, not just the people.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, the flow is important, but if the crews are exhausted, the flow stops. We need a plan that doesn’t break the staff.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the approval process is a risk, but the pilots show we can do it. We just need to be careful.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the pilots were eight years ago. The situation has changed. The pre-war shells are a trap.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, the connections are the problem, but the budget is the constraint. We need a plan that is both efficient and affordable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, I agree. The budget is tight, but the journey audits show where the time goes. We need to fix the connections.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I’m worried about the staffing. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on overtime.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I’m excited to see what we find! Let’s hope the data shows us the best path.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I will review my findings before we vote. The past is the only honest witness.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll stick with my two choices. Understanding the real costs is the only way to predict if this will survive.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I’m ready to see what’s really going on. Let’s hope everything checks out!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
