60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"The candidates are A: Crosstown Bus Corridor, B: Night Service Extension, C: Station Access Upgrades, D: Integrated Fare Platform.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"I’m leaning towards B. The late-evening pilot worked, and it’s a proven idea.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"I’m worried about C. The pre-war shells are a trap, and the approval process is risky.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m concerned about D. The ticketing fees are high, and the budget is tight.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"I’m leaning towards A. The journey audits show the connections are the problem, and a bus corridor could help.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, B is risky. The late-turn pool is empty, and we can’t afford the overtime.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, I hear you. But the pilot worked. We just need to manage the staffing carefully.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, D is a trap. The operators never agreed on data terms. It will stall.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. D is too risky. A seems more balanced.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, A is the best choice. It fixes the connections and doesn’t rely on the exhausted crews.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, A is a good choice. It uses the existing infrastructure and doesn’t require new staffing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, I agree. A is the safest bet. It fixes the real problem.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, A is the only option that avoids the pre-war shells and the approval risks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. A is the most balanced choice for our budget.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I’m so happy we all agree! A is the best choice. I vote for A!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Takumi, I agree. A is the only path that respects our current reality. I vote for A.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, I concur. A is the only choice supported by the evidence. I vote for A.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, I agree. A is the enduring path. I vote for A.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, I agree. A is the most balanced choice. I vote for A.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I’m so happy we’re all on the same page! A is the clear winner. I confirm my vote for it!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
